===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|geometry}} Any system of geometry not based on the set of [[axiom]]s of [[Euclidean geometry]], which is based on the [[three-dimensional]] [[space]] of common experience.

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|Euclidean geometry}}

